1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,481
Elena manages a home in Munich.

2
00:00:02,481 --> 00:00:10,006
When her Bosch washer failed at month 22, the retailer claimed the
one-year guarantee expired.

3
00:00:10,006 --> 00:00:16,169
Under European Directive 2019/771, sellers are strictly liable for
24 months.

4
00:00:16,169 --> 00:00:22,013
Elena paid 185 EUR out-of-pocket because nobody holds the legal
calendar.

5
00:00:22,663 --> 00:00:26,907
Hestia opens directly in the browser as a 3-column cockpit.

6
00:00:26,907 --> 00:00:36,188
Appliances with live 24-month statutory horizons down the left,
recurring subscriptions, and debits flagged for missing receipts.

7
00:00:36,188 --> 00:00:37,771
No new habit to learn.

8
00:00:37,771 --> 00:00:40,217
Financial status lands in seconds.

9
00:00:40,867 --> 00:00:43,115
Nothing waits to be asked.

10
00:00:43,115 --> 00:01:01,533
As bank debits post, Hestia reconciles statutory law, subscription baselines, and receipt archives autonomously: 185
EUR repair reimbursable, 4 EUR monthly price creep detected, and an 85 EUR outlay missing proof.

11
00:01:02,183 --> 00:01:03,303
Then it stops.

12
00:01:03,303 --> 00:01:06,585
Hestia never acts without human approval.

13
00:01:06,585 --> 00:01:13,550
On the live site, Elena reviews the pre-drafted Article 10 formal
notice to MediaMarkt.

14
00:01:13,550 --> 00:01:18,273
One click approves it, sealing an immutable dispute record.

15
00:01:18,273 --> 00:01:22,755
The cockpit is live now at drusjukc9d4oc.cloudfront.net.

16
00:01:23,405 --> 00:01:27,479
Amazon Bedrock and AWS Serverless make that possible.

17
00:01:27,479 --> 00:01:33,552
Pure integer math in Lambda Action Groups eliminates arithmetic
hallucinations.

18
00:01:33,552 --> 00:01:39,932
Bedrock orchestrates the digest while Guardrails filter card data
before inference.

19
00:01:39,932 --> 00:01:43,467
CloudFront delivers sub-second response times.

20
00:01:44,117 --> 00:01:47,424
Every claim is checkable without asking us.

21
00:01:47,424 --> 00:01:53,959
The repository carries 37 tests with 100 percent statement and
branch coverage in CI.

22
00:01:53,959 --> 00:02:02,187
The ablation suite measures each rule: remove the statutory engine
and recovery drops from 185 EUR to zero.

23
00:02:02,187 --> 00:02:05,108
Zero em dashes, zero marketing claims.

24
00:02:05,758 --> 00:02:19,386
Hestia reconciles household debits against statutory warranty law and
subscription baselines, recovering out-of-pocket appliance repairs through human-approved legal notices.

25
00:02:19,386 --> 00:02:22,283
Live on AWS, login-free, open source.

26
00:02:22,283 --> 00:02:24,241
Try the cockpit yourself.
